That's what I SHOULD have done anyway, I thought as I lay awake until 
2am. I COULD have done it, I'm sure. SURE! The truth is that when I 
stood on the right altar, I was just so glad it was over. And it was 
late. More than 100000 turns is a bit too much for me. The NEXT time!

[Notes to self: Don't offer your gold until the very end. It's so easy 
to loose protection. Keep a tin of floating eye meat in the ascension 
kit. It's apparently easy to loose telepathy, too. I must have 
"inadvertently" killed a high priest on the astral plane, because he was 
listed in my "kill" list, but if so, it must have been with a single 
whack, because I certainly didn't mean to.]

